solution:
Using the vertex and focus, we can see that the equation of the directrix must be $y = -1.$

[asy]
unitsize(3 cm);

real func (real x) {
  return(x^2);
}

pair F, P, Q;

F = (0,1/4);
P = (0.8,func(0.8));
Q = (0.8,-1/4);

draw(graph(func,-1,1));
draw((-1,-1/4)--(1,-1/4),dashed);
draw(F--P--Q);

