\[(\mathbf{v} - \mathbf{p}) \cdot \mathbf{w} = 0.\]Then $\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w} - \mathbf{p} \cdot \mathbf{w} = 0$,
so $\mathbf{p} \cdot \mathbf{w} = \mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w} = -3$.

