&= \frac{-3}{5^2} \mathbf{w} \\
&= -\frac{3}{25} \mathbf{w}.
\end{align*}The magnitude of $\operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v}$ is $\boxed{\frac{3}{5}}.$The answer is \frac{3}{5}

